      "title": "竞速超新星！·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21070001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "咳咳，啊糟糕，遥控车不幸坏掉了，追逐游戏到此结束——开玩笑的，当当~在大家齐心协力的努力下，已经完全修好了喔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "你们看，非常牢固，嗯嗯，完全没有问题！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……不要用力拍车头阿，不然又会散掉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "狩猎者越跑越远了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "哦对，正事要紧！快上车快上车~感谢大家的晃悠悠~~~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "太慢了，大家跟好，听我指挥。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "难缠，真是阴魂不散的家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "嗨多磨~这次是全新的《猫鼠游戏》，目标——超性感的成熟大姐姐！抓到的话就会怎么样呢，怎，么，样，呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "第三次追猎行动，全速前进，冲冲冲——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……心脏要跳出来了！不要突然加速啦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这里抄近路，左转——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "前面路口，右转，逼她调头——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21070013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "现在加速——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "砰——！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "呃……该死！蠢货，昏了头吗？为什么停在这里！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "遥控车",
          "text": "头儿，前面开不了了，这是乐园，到处都是出来玩的手办……头儿，头儿——等等我啊！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江好厉害~果然抓到了~\n哼，仗势欺人的家伙，看你还往哪里跑！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "这个底盘难道就是传说中的PVC材质吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "遥控车",
          "text": "侮辱，你，你这是……赤裸裸的侮辱！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "花Q！超性感成熟的大姐姐跑到乐园里面去了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "我去拦住她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哎，花迦——小心——那边是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "noticeKind": "video",
          "sourceId": "21071010",
          "sourceType": 11,
          "text": "此处为游戏视频演出，尚未转写为文字。",
          "type": "notice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "手机……直播？不可以播出去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "所以我们刚才的行动……都被直播出去了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哎——不可以！别跑，爱酱——快把直播关掉——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21071014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "阿哦，花Q，轮到我的回合了吗，不会乖乖站在原地被你们抓到喔，科科科科~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-429",
